@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam ArrowColor #111111
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #111111
skinparam LifeLineBackgroundColor white
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #111111
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor #111111
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white

actor "用户" as User
participant "讨论区页面" as Page
participant "Gateway" as Gateway
participant "PostQuestionCommentController" as Controller
participant "PostQuestionCommentService" as CommentService
database "Redis" as Redis
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "ConnectSSEController" as SSEController
participant "EmitterManager" as Emitter

User -> Page: 发表评论 / 点赞
Page -> Gateway: POST /user/questionComment/...
Gateway -> Controller: 转发评论请求
Controller -> CommentService: addComment() / likeComment()
CommentService -> Redis: 解析虚拟题目ID
Redis --> CommentService: 返回真实题目ID
CommentService -> DB: 写入评论或点赞关系
DB --> CommentService: 写入成功
CommentService --> Controller: 返回处理结果
Controller --> Page: 刷新评论列表

== 消息推送链路 ==
Page -> SSEController: 建立 SSE 连接
SSEController -> Emitter: 创建连接对象
SSEController -> Redis: 标记用户在线
Redis --> SSEController: 标记成功

opt AI 结果完成或基础消息到达
  Emitter --> Page: 推送消息事件
  Page -> Page: 更新铃铛提示与页面状态
end
@enduml
